### Single Instance Demo (both hit port 8080)

# Step 1: Send a message to Instance A
POST http://localhost:8080/send?message=hxxllo

###

# Step 2: Receive from the same instance — works
GET http://localhost:8080/receive

###

### Two Instance Demo (demonstrates the pitfall)
# Start Instance A: mvn spring-boot:run
# Start Instance B: SERVER_PORT=8081 mvn spring-boot:run

# Step 3: Send to Instance A (port 8080)
POST http://localhost:8080/send?message=hello

###

# Step 4: Receive from Instance B (port 8081) — returns "No message" (the pitfall)
GET http://localhost:8081/receive

###

# Step 5: Receive from Instance A (port 8080) — still has it, trapped in A's heap
GET http://localhost:8080/receive
